// Permit GetStockInfo only when the requested stock is "AMZN".
//
// New idea: inside a rule whose scope pins a specific action, the
// per-tool input record from mcp_tools.json is exposed as
// `context.input`. Here we read its `stock: String` field and
// compare it to a double-quoted string literal.

permit(
    principal,
    action == Drupe::Action::"GetStockInfo",
    resource
) when {
    context.input.stock == "AMZN"
};
